  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29330001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "|101|，你在做什么？这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是《终焉地平线》……呃，该怎么说呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我明白，这是以「那个世界」为蓝本制作的战术竞技游戏吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "选择界面上有很多熟悉的人，泉、我，甚至还有……塞拉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，可以这么理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "最近回归玩了一段时间，但在队长模式里老是输呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "那么，我来帮你吧。有相关的资料库吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这样都可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一天后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "对面的战术意图很明显，想要通过偏前期发育的阵容取得线上优势，然后全力推进。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "禁用「狩猎者」，然后选「希塔」吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "居然推荐自己吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "别误会，只是「希塔」的AOE机制和攻速增益可以克制对面的召唤物。「狩猎者」则可能补强对面的阵容。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "选好了。屏幕上是希塔，身边又是希塔在讲话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29330016",
              "text": "感觉好酷"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29330016",
              "text": "感觉好奇怪"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29330015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "接下来，还有……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "就这样，时间流逝——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29330018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "回过神来……居然已经连续赢了五把？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
